61	/**
62	 * Resolve the effective minimum severity from the two supported inputs.
63	 *
64	 * The two inputs do NOT carry defaults in `action.yml`. That keeps
65	 * `core.getInput()` returning `''` when a workflow has not set the input,
66	 * which is what lets a workflow that only sets the alias (`minimum-severity`)
67	 * actually take effect. Precedence is:
68	 *
69	 *   1. `min-severity` if set
70	 *   2. `minimum-severity` if set
71	 *   3. fallback to `DEFAULT_MINIMUM_SEVERITY`
72	 *
73	 * If both are set to different values, `min-severity` wins and a warning is
74	 * emitted so the workflow author can collapse the inputs.
